WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.140
Build your plugin in two minutes.

2
00:00:02.890 --> 00:00:10.716
Step 1. On Build Your Plugin, fill in the form. Name, grade, subject, and your tips.

3
00:00:11.466 --> 00:00:15.812
Step 2. Tap Make My Plugin, then tap Copy.

4
00:00:16.562 --> 00:00:21.484
Step 3. Paste it into a Gemini Gem, and try it out.

5
00:00:22.234 --> 00:00:29.748
Step 4. Go to Post on the Store. Set your Rent or Buy price, and post.

6
00:00:30.498 --> 00:00:33.908
That's it. Payments are coming soon.
